# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Local environment configuration
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local Dart configuration
dart_defines.json
# Every other defines file too — `dart_defines.local.json` points a debug build
# at the local Supabase stack for manual testing. Only the committed example,
# which carries placeholders and no real values, is exempt.
dart_defines.*.json
!dart_defines.example.json
